            </note>
            <note corresp="#d459-f2" n="6" xml:id="d459-f2-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 180, April 18, 7 p.m., from the Minister in China, <ref
                        target="#pg113">p. 113</ref>.</p>
            </note>
